# Cloudflare Pages redirects — the second deploy path.
#
# This file is the Pages translation of the `handle` blocks in deploy/Caddyfile.
# A static export cannot redirect on its own, so if these are missing here, every
# URL this site has ever published under 404s the moment the mirror is the thing
# answering. Change one file, change the other.
#
# Pages syntax: one rule per line, `from to status`, `:splat` carries the
# wildcard through. Splats are only allowed at the end of a pattern.
/posts/*   /writing/:splat  301
/tags/*    /topics/:splat   301
/blog      /writing/        301
/blog/*    /writing/        301
/resume    /cv/             301
/resume/*  /cv/             301
/now       /about/          301
/now/*     /about/          301
/uses      /about/          301
/uses/*    /about/          301
